#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:2
msgid "Async iterators"
msgstr "非同步迭代器"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:4
msgid ""
"An *async iterator* is the asyncio version of an iterator. The :doc:`Python "
"Overview <../../python/iteration/iterators-and-generators>` introduced the "
"synchronous iterator protocol -- ``__iter__`` and ``__next__`` -- and the "
"``for`` loop that drives it. Async iterators add an ``await`` to each step, "
"so the iterator can *wait* between values without blocking the event loop."
msgstr ""
"*非同步迭代器*\\ （async iterator）是迭代器的 asyncio 版本。\\ :doc:`Python 概觀 "
"<../../python/iteration/iterators-and-generators>` 介紹過同步的迭代器協定 -- "
"``__iter__`` 與 ``__next__`` -- 以及驅動它的 ``for`` 迴圈。非同步迭代器為每個步驟加上一個 ``await``\\"
" ，因此迭代器可以在產生值之間\\ *等待*\\ ，而不會阻塞事件迴圈。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:14
msgid "The protocol"
msgstr "協定"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:16
msgid "A class is an async iterator when it implements"
msgstr "當一個類別實作了下列方法時，它就是非同步迭代器"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:18
msgid "``__aiter__(self)`` -- returns the iterator object, usually ``self``."
msgstr "``__aiter__(self)`` -- 回傳迭代器物件，通常是 ``self``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:20
msgid ""
"``async def __anext__(self)`` -- returns the next value, or raises "
":exc:`StopAsyncIteration` when there are no more."
msgstr ""
"``async def __anext__(self)`` -- 回傳下一個值，或在沒有更多值時引發 "
":exc:`StopAsyncIteration`\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:24
msgid "The corresponding loop construct is ``async for``::"
msgstr "對應的迴圈結構是 ``async for``::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:51
msgid ""
"The ``async for`` loop awaits each call to ``__anext__``, so the coroutine "
"running the loop yields to the event loop between values just like any other"
" ``await``."
msgstr ""
"``async for`` 迴圈會 await 每次對 ``__anext__`` "
"的呼叫，因此執行該迴圈的協程會在產生值之間將控制權交還給事件迴圈，就和任何其他 ``await`` 一樣。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:56
msgid "When to reach for it"
msgstr "何時該使用它"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:58
msgid ""
"Whenever the application has a source of data that arrives *over time* and "
"the consumer should iterate it lazily. A sensor that produces a sample per "
"period, a network socket that delivers messages, a frame generator -- "
"anywhere the shape ``while True: x = await source.next(); process(x)`` fits,"
" ``async for x in source`` is the cleaner spelling."
msgstr ""
"只要應用程式有一個\\ *隨時間*\\ 陸續到達的資料來源，而消費端應該以惰性方式迭代它時，就適合使用。每隔一段時間產生一筆樣本的感測器、傳遞訊息的網路"
" socket、影格產生器 -- 任何符合 ``while True: x = await source.next(); process(x)`` "
"形式的地方，\\ ``async for x in source`` 都是更俐落的寫法。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/custom/async-iterators.rst:65
msgid ""
"For sources that emit until a finite end condition, the iterator raises "
":exc:`StopAsyncIteration` and ``async for`` exits normally. For sources that"
" never end -- a continuous sensor stream, a long-running subscription -- the"
" loop runs until the coroutine it lives in is cancelled or its task is torn "
"down."
msgstr ""
"對於會持續發出值直到某個有限結束條件的來源，迭代器會引發 :exc:`StopAsyncIteration`\\ ，而 ``async for`` "
"會正常結束。對於永不結束的來源 -- 持續不斷的感測器串流、長時間執行的訂閱 -- 迴圈會一直執行，直到它所在的協程被取消或其任務被拆除為止。"
